===Etymology===
{{bor|en|NL.|rectum}}, abbreviation of {{der|en|la||rectum intestinum|the straight intestine}}, {{m|la|rectum}}, neuter of {{m|la|rectus||straight}}. See {{m|en|right}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɹɛktəm/|lang=en}}
{{rfap|en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|recta|rectums}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The [[terminal]] part of the large [[intestine]] through which feces pass.

